@startuml navigation state diagram

title Navigation State Machine (gn10_navigation)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam shadowing false
scale max 4000*2500

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #444444
  FontSize 12
  ArrowColor #212121
  ArrowFontSize 11
  StartColor #2E7D32
  EndColor #C62828
}

[*] --> Standby : Node Initialization

Standby --> Ready : Localization Established
Ready --> Moving : Autonomous Move Command (NavigationCommand::Move)
Moving --> Fail : Localization / Comm Loss, Hazard Zone Entry, Timeout
Moving --> Goal : Reached Target Position (Residual Distance <= 3 cm)
Moving --> Ready : Move Canceled (NavigationCommand::Standby)
Goal --> Ready : Position Drift Exceeds Tolerance Margin
Ready --> Tracking : Target Tracking Command (TargetId::MovingBucket & Move)
Tracking --> Fail : Target Lost / Out of Trackable Range
Tracking --> Ready : Tracking Canceled (NavigationCommand::Standby)
Ready --> Fail : Autonomous Move Disabled
Fail --> Ready : Error Recovery (Localization Restored / Zone Cleared)

Standby : <b>Processing: Idle Standby</b>\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Standby\n• Waiting for Localization & Map Synchronization

Ready : <b>Processing: Armed & Ready</b>\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Ready\n• Ready to Accept Target Navigation & Tracking Commands

Moving : <b>Processing: Two-Stage Motion Control</b>\n• High-Speed Phase: Pure Pursuit (Lookahead = 0.4 m)\n• Fine Terminal Phase: Position Feedback (Residual <= 0.15 m)\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Moving

Goal : <b>Processing: Target Position Reached</b>\n• Precision Stop: Residual Distance <= 3 cm Satisfied\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Goal

Tracking : <b>Processing: Heading Alignment</b>\n• Continuous Yaw Rotation Facing Moving Bucket\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Tracking

Fail : <b>Processing: Safety Stop & Diagnostic Reporting</b>\n• State Output: NavigationStatus::Fail\n• Automatic Motion Inhibited

@enduml
